      "content": "wait 100mg? that sounds like a really small amount compared to what my doctor usually has me on. and do i really need to go to the er if it doesn't work in an hour?? i'm kinda scared to go to the hospital if it's just because of the supplement. can i just try drinking more water and taking the metformin first to see if it clears up?",
